    "answer": {
      "short": "Trade 15 blue marbles with Alice for 25 red marbles. Trade 24 red marbles with Carol for 15 blue marbles, leaving your original 15 blue marbles and one extra red marble.",
      "worked": "With Alice, $15\\div3=5$ exchanges give $5\\times5=25$ red marbles.\n\nWith Carol, $15\\div5=3$ exchanges recover 15 blue marbles and cost $3\\times8=24$ red marbles.\n\nYou retain $25-24=1$ red marble as well as your original 15 blue marbles, so the extra red marble is free.",
